<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>주문 결과</title>
</head>
<body>
	<h2>주문 정보</h2>
	<p>상품명 : <span th:text="${ordered_itemName}"></span></p>
	<p>단가 : <span th:text="${ordered_itemPrice}"></span></p>
	<p>수량 : <span th:text="${ordered_itemQty}"></span></p>
	<p>주문자 : <span th:text="${ordererName}"></span></p>
	<p>총금액 : <span th:text="${totalPrice}"></span></p>
</body>
</html>